WEBVTT

00:14:59.009 --> 00:15:03.637
MI-8 helikoptera.

00:15:03.637 --> 00:15:07.546
Slijetanje 3:14 i 48 sekundi,

00:15:07.546 --> 00:15:09.021
po CET vremenu.

00:15:09.021 --> 00:15:10.192
CH: i onda stanete

00:15:10.192 --> 00:15:11.861
kao da vas je neko bacio na zemlju,

00:15:11.861 --> 00:15:13.243
kapsula se pomjera tamo- vamo

00:15:13.243 --> 00:15:14.669
ali vi ste spremni za sve to.

00:15:14.669 --> 00:15:15.625
U vašem sjedištu,

00:15:15.625 --> 00:15:17.062
i znate da amortizeri rade.

00:15:17.062 --> 00:15:19.053
I kada vas Rusi pronađu,

00:15:19.053 --> 00:15:20.211
izvuku napolje,

00:15:20.211 --> 00:15:21.911
stave u stolicu,

00:15:21.911 --> 00:15:25.354
i kada pogledate prema gore,

00:15:25.354 --> 00:15:28.536
znate da ste prošli jedno divno iskustvo.

00:15:28.536 --> 00:15:30.503
Da ste postigli svoj san